    "robot_salvage_parts": {
      "summary": "Computer/laptop → explore currently observed interactions → Purchase Upgrade Parts → Robot Salvage Parts (personal inventory). Intermediate menu labels and depth must be observed, not assumed.",
      "steps": [
        "Select the Sim who needs the parts and keep Live Mode paused.",
        "Find an observed computer/laptop inside the active lot.",
        "On user command and with player-control admission, open that computer's interactions.",
        "Explore observed nested options (such as Order or More Choices only if actually visible) until Purchase Upgrade Parts appears.",
        "Choose Robot Salvage Parts in the observed picker.",
        "After explicit funds/price/spend-cap approval, confirm ONE purchase.",
        "Verify the part increased in the selected Sim's personal inventory before considering another purchase."
      ],
      "lab_bulk_alternative": "In a disposable lab, the existing optional testingcheats robotics-workstation Spawn Crafting Supplies path remains separate; never activate cheats automatically.",
